<title>SWEDEN: Average auction yld on Swedish 4-yr bond 5.93 pct.</title>
<headline>Average auction yld on Swedish 4-yr bond 5.93 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted yield on an auction of three billion crowns of four-year bonds was 5.93 percent, the National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>						Loan 1036</p>
<p> Volume issued (billions)		 3.0</p>
<p> Total bids    (billions)		 6.13</p>
<p> Number of accepted bids		 25</p>
<p> Number of bids			    63</p>
<p> Lowest yields				5.925 pct</p>
<p> Highest yields			     5.940 pct</p>
<p> Weighted average yield		   5.934 pct</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
